{"time": 1764682833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019595825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "所以你拆了螺丝钉之后，门就打开了"}
{"time": 1764682848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027763076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "外面则是一个空空如也的阳台"}
