{"time": 1764683253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911911540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "hh"}
{"time": 1764683263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423512022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们花了一段时间把泥怪烧死了"}
{"time": 1764683294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039025704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你们惊讶的发现，他的肚子里竟然有一个次级念力头冠"}
{"time": 1764683346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685622391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(hh"}
{"time": 1764683419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115285077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你们一回去就去找了那本书"}
{"time": 1764683431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "112929585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "书的目录上果然写着七个物品"}
{"time": 1764683577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382124830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "子爵璽戒\n猫之尾\n食尸鬼王的头骨\n绿色石偶\n使节的心形石\n船长的三角帽\n长蹼的红脚"}
{"time": 1764683590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650752675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "分别是这七样东西"}
{"time": 1764683617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792724652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很明显这些东西大概都在书里有记载，可以通过看书来确定在幻梦境的哪个位置"}
